    glib-compile-schemas ~/.local/share/glib-2.0/schemas/   (Linux)
    or set GSETTINGS_SCHEMA_DIR to the directory containing the
    compiled binary schema.

  Set the archive root:
    gsettings set dev.roither.belegablage belege-root '/home/georg/belege-archiv'
